# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Dangerous! poster hangs by the inn; Apothecary Lydon stands inside it. Christoph Jeffcoat, the cook by the inn, wants turtle meat and sells the spices for it.
  accept 567 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Dangerous!, the poster by the inn; inside
  accept 509 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Apothecary Lydon, inside
  accept 7321                         -- Christoph Jeffcoat: Soothing Turtle Bisque, the Snapjaws of the river south of town; inside
  buy 3713 npc 2393                   -- Soothing Spices, from Christoph Jeffcoat

step High Executor Darthalia
  when !turnedin 529
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  accept 529 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- High Executor Darthalia

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
  accept 552 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Novice Thaivand, in the town: Helcular's Rod, from the yetis on the way to the town hall
  tip North-east back to Tarren Mill, passing well north of Southshore (its guards are 55).
  accept 533 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Krusk, inside: Infiltration, worked on the 38-39 visit (its Syndicate are 32-35)
  note Keep Infiltration in your log: its Syndicate (32-35) are over you now, and the 38-39 guide (Alterac and Arathi) works it on its first Tarren Mill loop.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: the river and the Mudsnout gnolls

step The river south of Tarren Mill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South from Tarren Mill along the river: Snapjaws (29) sun themselves on its banks all the way down to the hills above Southshore. Some of them carry Turtle Meat.
  collect 3712 quest 7321.1 @67.8,28.0 map 1424 -- Turtle Meat, from the Snapjaws

step To Mudsnout Blossoms
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 64.4,61.3 "To Mudsnout Blossoms"

step Mudsnout Blossoms
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South of the river's bend, the Mudsnout gnolls (26-28) camp in the hills above Dun Garok; the blossoms grow among their tents. The Shamans heal and call their friends: pull them first.
  collect 3502 quest 509 @64.2,61.4 map 1424 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Mudsnout Blossoms

step North of Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip From the blossoms, back north along the river and then west to Hillsbrad town, well north of Southshore (its guards are 55).
  goto 60.0,42.0 map 1424 "North of Southshore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The smithy and the fields

step The smithy
  when !turnedin 529
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West across the foothills to Hillsbrad town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the west side of the town; Farmer Kalaba works the field south-east of the town.
  kill 2404 quest 529.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 2265 quest 529.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 3564 quest 529.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside

step Town hall
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip On to Hillsbrad town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town.
  kill 2448 quest 567.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside

