  kill 2449 quest 567.2 @30.6,40.5 map 1424 era only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Citizen Wilkes, on the west side of the town
  kill 2451 quest 567.4 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Farmer Kalaba walks around Hillsbrad Fields: look inside the circle on the map

