# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The yeti caves and the town hall

step Helcular's Rod
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West of Tarren Mill, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the Foothill Caverns in the hills; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but they hit hard and come in pairs.
  collect 3708 quest 552 @44.5,29.4 map 1424 era only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Town hall
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  kill 2387 quest 532.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Hillsbrad Councilman walks around Hillsbrad Fields: look inside the circle on the map
  interact 1761 quest 532.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Hillsbrad Proclamation, inside
  collect 3657 quest 532.4 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside
  kill 2335 quest 532.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 532 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 539 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  turnin 552 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Novice Thaivand
  note Thaivand's next errand, the flames, sends you among the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) and to Helcular's grave inside Southshore: leave it.

