step Level 30
  when level<30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Magus Wordeen Voidglare's quests on the next Tarren Mill stop and Alliance Relations in Orgrimmar, the next guide's first stop, are offered from level 30. Short of 30? The Torn Fin Muckdwellers and Coastrunners (28-30) crowd the coast south of the Azurelode Mine, a short walk: kill them until level 30. Their Oracles (30-31) cast from the shore further east. Or, with a group, run the Excavation Site dungeon (in the Wetlands) instead.
  goto 29.5,71.5 map 1424 "Torn Fin murlocs"
  level 30 grind 2375                 -- grind on Torn Fin Coastrunner

