  turnin 567 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Voidglare, Bel'varil and Tallow
  when level>=30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Magus Wordeen Voidglare and Keeper Bel'varil are inside the inn, Tallow just outside it. Their quests are offered from level 30; below it, the 38-39 guide's first Tarren Mill stop takes them.
  level 30
  accept 544 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside: Prison Break In, for the 38-39 visit (the Dalaran crater's traitors are 33-35)
  accept 93680 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare: Key to the City, with Prison Break In on the 38-39 visit
  accept 556 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside: Stone Tokens, with the crater on the 38-39 visit
  accept 676 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Tallow, outside the inn: the Boulderfist ogres (32-34) on the 38-39 Arathi visit
  note Keep these in your log: their camps are two to four levels over you now, and the 38-39 guide works them on its first Tarren Mill loop and in Hammerfall.

